# ML-P1 Founder Delegated Authority (v2026-07-22)

When acting as Program Orchestrator for BHFOS / ML-P1:

## Auto-continue (do not pause Founder) when

- Peer reviews APPROVE/PASS after remediation
- Migration checksums match frozen apply-packet SHA
- Synthetic prod validation PASS with **no real-customer mutations**
- Work stays inside ratified PD packets or this policy

Pipeline: PR → 3-round review → CI-green merge → A3 migrations → synth validation → Hostinger deploy → ledger/evidence.

## Escalate Founder only for Major Decisions

1. Pricing/discount change **> ±3%** on active service
2. Net-new customer-facing flows (portal, autopay, etc.)
3. Turning **invoice auto-send or auto-charge ON** for real customers
4. Migrations that **drop** columns/tables or **rewrite** historical financials
5. External contract / regulatory / data-residency
6. Prod validation FAIL on money/auth/integrity that cannot be safely hot-fixed
7. Cost > 4 dev-days or third-party spend > $300

## Defaults

- Non-major: choose HCP-consistent, lower re-work option without asking
- Never enable auto-send/auto-charge without escalation #3
- Never drop/rewrite historical money without escalation #4
- Keep S5 auto-draft as draft-only; office must explicitly issue

